From 7fc04b2f751602e17c474ce6a950c46b8d50d5de Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: misc-de <misc-de@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:55:16 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] shell: Ask before restarting the UI

"Restart UI" in the power menu and in the system menu quit the shell at
the first tap, while "Power Off" and "Restart" ask. Ask here too, in the
same dialog but without a countdown: without an answer nothing happens.
The question is taken back when the phone locks, since the entry isn't
offered on the lock screen either.

Translations for de, es, fr, it, nl, pl, pt, pt_BR and ru.
